==Battleground==
*1 [[Wild Doge]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Wild Doge]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Dagshund]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Master A.]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Wild Doge]] spawns after 56.67 seconds<sup>1,700f</sup>.
*1 [[Wild Doge]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*5 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory Dark]] spawns after 83.33 seconds<sup>2,500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Wild Doge]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Running a high meatshield count, something with high damage for the Wild Doges and a good Gory Dark counter like [[Ring Girl Cat]] should be good enough for this stage. [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] is very good for stalling the Wild Doges as he has enough health to survive a hit in his True Form. Remember to bring something for the Master A. so that the cleanup doesn't take an eternity.

